    "300g arborio rice or carnaroli rice,",
    "1 glass dry white wine,",
    "1.5 l chicken stock,",
    "a small bunch of chives (snipped)."
  ],
  "recipeInstructions": [
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "1. Put the haddock in a heatproof dish and just cover with boiling water. Cover with clingfilm and leave for 10 minutes. Flake into decent-sized chunks."
