      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "4. Pour in the wine and stir until absorbed."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "5. Add the stock, a ladleful at a time, stirring each lot in, until the rice is just tender and creamy."
    },
